in each row of the matrix.\n\nWe can see that $B$ has $2$ pivots in the $2$nd and $3$rd columns:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403668 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124478 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5f0d2e9-1cf6-5fe4-85cc-f401382f39b2" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Non-Pivot Columns of a Matrix in Row Echelon Form" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049723 :topic/id #uuid "0e15397e-6c32-508c-b6ea-90f1a9e5a237" :topic/math-academy-id 1904 :topic/title "Identifying the Pivot Columns of a Matrix"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e946b723-08f5-581e-9484-b34ed2528e2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574471} {:answer/id #uuid "ed97673a-37dd-5981-9acc-aa50feeeeab9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574472}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e946b723-08f5-581e-9484-b34ed2528e2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574471} :answer-field/id #uuid "cabc66e8-6145-52ef-9ce9-5e6d49fc2ff0" :answer-field/key "Column 1: $\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574718} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9210045f-b525-518d-87de-bbf6aff3ff82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574473} {:answer/id #uuid "ed109d7b-fd44-5929-8f16-4989c4a98eb7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574474}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed109d7b-fd44-5929-8f16-4989c4a98eb7" :answer